// Matcher.fol — package source file
// Spec: language-ref.md > Matchers > Custom Matcher
//
// The contract a custom matcher implements. `matchCase` receives the subject
// and the untyped pattern and reports:
//
//     0   no match
//     >0  match
//
// together with the bindings the pattern introduced.

@co.dap.matcher
_(T) = {
    matchCase(value T, pattern co.lang.untyped)->(co.lang.int, co.lang.MatchBindings);
}
